{
  "info": {
    "name": "SliceSplit Backend",
    "_postman_id": "a8f3e4d1-9b2c-4a7e-8f1d-3c2b1a9e8d7f",
    "description": "INR-first expense-splitting backend for Slice Hackathon 2.\n\nBase URL is configured via the `{{base_url}}` env var (default `http://localhost:4000`).\n\n**Auth flow**\n1. Run `Auth > Register` or `Auth > Login` — the test script auto-stores `access_token` and `refresh_token` on the active environment.\n2. All subsequent authenticated requests pick up `{{access_token}}` via the Bearer auth.\n3. When the access token expires, run `Auth > Refresh` to rotate.\n\nFolder map mirrors `src/modules/`:\n- Health\n- Auth\n- Me\n- Groups (CRUD + members)\n- Expenses (per-group, CRUD with EQUAL/EXACT/PERCENTAGE/SHARES split)\n- Settlements (per-group)\n- Balances (per-group summary + UPI deep links)\n- Contacts (address book)\n- Receipts (AI extraction + convert to expense)\n- Guest Splits (Owner) + Guest Splits (Public — no auth, share-token scoped)\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_prefix", "value": "/api/v1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Liveness and readiness probes. No auth.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health/live", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["health", "live"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness (checks DB)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["health", "ready"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Register, login, refresh, logout. Login + Register auto-set {{access_token}} and {{refresh_token}}.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('user_id', body.user.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Alice\",\n  \"password\": \"sup3rs3cret\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919876543210\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('user_id', body.user.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alice@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"sup3rs3cret\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
            "  const body = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.environment.set('access_token', body.accessToken);",
            "  pm.environment.set('refresh_token', body.refreshToken);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Me",
      "description": "Profile endpoints. Bearer auth.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get my profile",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["me"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Alice K.\",\n  \"upiHandle\": \"alice@okhdfc\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["me"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Groups",
      "description": "Group CRUD + member management.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my groups",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups?limit=20", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "20" }, { "key": "archived", "value": "false", "disabled": true }, { "key": "cursor", "value": "", "disabled": true }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create group",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  pm.environment.set('group_id', pm.response.json().group.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Goa Trip\",\n  \"emoji\": \"🏖️\",\n  \"description\": \"Dec 2025 plan\",\n  \"simplifyDebts\": true\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get group by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update group",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Goa Trip — final\",\n  \"description\": \"Locked-in itinerary\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Archive group",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"archived\": true\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add member",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\",\n  \"role\": \"MEMBER\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/members", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "members"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove member",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/members/REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "members", "REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Expenses",
      "description": "Per-group expenses. Supports EQUAL / EXACT / PERCENTAGE / SHARES split modes. All amounts are paise.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List expenses",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses?limit=20", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "20" }, { "key": "cursor", "value": "", "disabled": true }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create expense — EQUAL",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  pm.environment.set('expense_id', pm.response.json().expense.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Dinner\",\n  \"amountPaise\": 250000,\n  \"category\": \"food\",\n  \"paidById\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"split\": {\n    \"mode\": \"EQUAL\",\n    \"userIds\": [\"{{user_id}}\", \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\"]\n  }\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create expense — EXACT",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Petrol\",\n  \"amountPaise\": 100000,\n  \"paidById\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"split\": {\n    \"mode\": \"EXACT\",\n    \"shares\": [\n      { \"userId\": \"{{user_id}}\", \"amountPaise\": 60000 },\n      { \"userId\": \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\", \"amountPaise\": 40000 }\n    ]\n  }\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create expense — PERCENTAGE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Rent\",\n  \"amountPaise\": 3000000,\n  \"paidById\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"split\": {\n    \"mode\": \"PERCENTAGE\",\n    \"shares\": [\n      { \"userId\": \"{{user_id}}\", \"basisPoints\": 5000 },\n      { \"userId\": \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\", \"basisPoints\": 5000 }\n    ]\n  }\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create expense — SHARES",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Groceries\",\n  \"amountPaise\": 120000,\n  \"paidById\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"split\": {\n    \"mode\": \"SHARES\",\n    \"shares\": [\n      { \"userId\": \"{{user_id}}\", \"shares\": 1 },\n      { \"userId\": \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\", \"shares\": 2 }\n    ]\n  }\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get expense",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses/{{expense_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses", "{{expense_id}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update expense (title only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Dinner at Mahesh Lunch Home\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses/{{expense_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses", "{{expense_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete expense (soft)",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/expenses/{{expense_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "expenses", "{{expense_id}}"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Settlements",
      "description": "Per-group settlements (settle-ups). Validates that both parties are active group members.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List settlements",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/settlements?limit=20", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "settlements"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "20" }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create settlement",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"fromId\": \"REPLACE_WITH_DEBTOR_CUID\",\n  \"toId\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"amountPaise\": 50000,\n  \"method\": \"UPI\",\n  \"note\": \"Paid via Slice\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/settlements", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "settlements"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Balances",
      "description": "Computes per-member balances + minimal-transfer settle-up suggestions, including UPI deep-link intents.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get group balances",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/groups/{{group_id}}/balances", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["groups", "{{group_id}}", "balances"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Contacts",
      "description": "Address book owned by the caller. Linked to platform users on phone/email match.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List contacts",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/contacts?limit=50", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["contacts"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "50" }, { "key": "search", "value": "", "disabled": true }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create contact",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  pm.environment.set('contact_id', pm.response.json().contact.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Bob\",\n  \"phone\": \"+919812345678\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/contacts", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["contacts"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update contact",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Bobby\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/contacts/{{contact_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["contacts", "{{contact_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete contact",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/contacts/{{contact_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["contacts", "{{contact_id}}"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Receipts",
      "description": "AI-powered receipt extraction. POST /extract is multipart/form-data — Postman handles this if you attach a real image to the `image` field.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my receipts",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/receipts?limit=20", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["receipts"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "20" }, { "key": "groupId", "value": "{{group_id}}", "disabled": true }] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload + extract receipt",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  pm.environment.set('receipt_id', pm.response.json().receipt.id);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "image", "type": "file", "src": "", "description": "Attach a real receipt image" },
                { "key": "groupId", "type": "text", "value": "{{group_id}}" },
                { "key": "hint", "type": "text", "value": "splits among 3 friends" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/receipts/extract", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["receipts", "extract"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get receipt",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/receipts/{{receipt_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["receipts", "{{receipt_id}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Convert receipt to expense (EQUAL)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Cafe Bistro\",\n  \"paidById\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"splitMode\": \"EQUAL\",\n  \"userIds\": [\"{{user_id}}\", \"REPLACE_WITH_USER_CUID\"]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/receipts/{{receipt_id}}/convert", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["receipts", "{{receipt_id}}", "convert"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Guest Splits (Owner)",
      "description": "Authenticated endpoints — create / list / view your guest splits. The shareToken returned is what the public folder uses.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List my guest splits",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/guest-splits", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["guest-splits"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create guest split",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  const g = pm.response.json().guestSplit;",
            "  pm.environment.set('guest_split_id', g.id);",
            "  pm.environment.set('share_token', g.shareToken);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"merchantName\": \"Cafe Bistro\",\n  \"totalPaise\": 97175,\n  \"taxPaise\": 4225,\n  \"tipPaise\": 8450,\n  \"peopleNames\": [\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\"],\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"name\": \"Veg Pizza\", \"quantity\": 1, \"unitPaise\": 45000, \"totalPaise\": 45000 },\n    { \"name\": \"Pasta Arrabbiata\", \"quantity\": 1, \"unitPaise\": 28500, \"totalPaise\": 28500 },\n    { \"name\": \"Iced Latte\", \"quantity\": 2, \"unitPaise\": 5500, \"totalPaise\": 11000 }\n  ]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/guest-splits", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["guest-splits"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get owned split (with claim tokens)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/guest-splits/{{guest_split_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["guest-splits", "{{guest_split_id}}"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Guest Splits (Public)",
      "description": "No-auth endpoints scoped by shareToken. Anyone with the link can view, add themselves, claim items.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "View by share token",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "auth": { "type": "noauth" }, "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/g/{{share_token}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["g", "{{share_token}}"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add person",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
            "  pm.environment.set('claim_token', pm.response.json().person.claimToken);",
            "}"
          ] } }],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Diya\",\n  \"upiHandle\": \"diya@okhdfc\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}/g/{{share_token}}/people", "host": ["{{base_url}}{{api_prefix}}"], "path": ["g", "{{share_token}}", "people"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Claim items",
